# Security Requirements
Rule Type: Always

## Credential Management
### API Keys
- Never commit API keys
- Use environment variables
- Encrypt sensitive data
- Rotate keys regularly
- Monitor key usage

### Access Control
- Implement role-based access
- Use strong authentication
- Enforce password policies
- Monitor access attempts
- Log security events

## Trading Security
### Paper Trading
- Implement paper trading mode
- Validate paper trading logic
- Monitor paper trading limits
- Track paper trading performance
- Document paper trading rules

### Order Safety
- Add safety checks for order sizes
- Validate all inputs
- Implement circuit breakers
- Monitor order flow
- Track execution quality

## Data Security
### Market Data
- Validate market data
- Monitor data quality
- Handle data gaps
- Secure data storage
- Backup critical data

### Trade Data
- Encrypt trade data
- Secure trade storage
- Monitor trade flow
- Track trade history
- Backup trade records

## System Security
### Network Security
- Use secure connections
- Implement firewalls
- Monitor network traffic
- Log security events
- Regular security audits

### Application Security
- Validate all inputs
- Sanitize user data
- Prevent SQL injection
- Handle errors securely
- Regular security updates

## Risk Management
### Trading Limits
- Set position limits
- Implement loss limits
- Monitor exposure
- Track risk metrics
- Enforce risk rules

### System Limits
- Set resource limits
- Monitor system usage
- Implement timeouts
- Handle overloads
- Track performance

## Monitoring
### Security Monitoring
- Monitor access attempts
- Track security events
- Log security incidents
- Alert on suspicious activity
- Regular security reviews

### Trading Monitoring
- Monitor order flow
- Track execution quality
- Monitor risk metrics
- Alert on anomalies
- Regular performance reviews

## Compliance
### Regulatory Requirements
- Follow trading regulations
- Maintain audit trails
- Document compliance
- Regular compliance reviews
- Update with regulations

### Internal Policies
- Follow security policies
- Document procedures
- Regular policy reviews
- Update policies
- Train team members

## Incident Response
### Security Incidents
- Document incident response
- Define escalation paths
- Regular incident drills
- Update procedures
- Learn from incidents

### Trading Incidents
- Document trading incidents
- Define recovery procedures
- Regular recovery drills
- Update procedures
- Learn from incidents
